      "id": "nt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 614,
      "width": 1051.5,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "Note: the filled diamond is composition — when a Notification goes away, its delivery attempts go with it.\nChannel is an abstract class, and PushChannel and EmailChannel implement it (only push is drawn here).",
      "originalText": "Note: the filled diamond is composition — when a Notification goes away, its delivery attempts go with it.\nChannel is an abstract class, and PushChannel and EmailChannel implement it (only push is drawn here).",
